      "urgency": "Expected",
      "certainty": "Likely",
      "headline": "High Wind Warning issued October 27 at 3:04PM HST until October 28 at 12:00PM HST by NWS Honolulu HI",
      "description": "* WHAT...Southwest winds 30 to 40 mph with gusts up to 80 mph\nexpected.\n\n* WHERE...Big Island Summits.\n\n* WHEN...Until noon HST Wednesday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Winds this strong can make driving and walking dangerous.\nThe winds can forcefully open doors and damage hinges or slam doors\nshut, possibly causing injuries.",
      "instruction": "Motorists, especially those in high profile vehicles, are urged to\ndrive with extreme caution.",
